  "description": "After a failed marriage, Camilla returns to the grand estate where she once worked as a maid—only to find that Mika Aberdeen, the young master she used to care for, has grown into a flirtatious playboy, constantly surrounded by women. He teases her relentlessly, igniting a desire in her to turn the tables and toy with him instead. But just as she’s about to strike, she stumbles upon a shocking secret—Mika is still a virgin?! As Camilla finds herself caught in a whirlwind of teasing and temptation, things take an even messier turn when her ex-boyfriend, Felix, suddenly returns to the estate…\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
